<title>UK: Shell announces 2-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Shell announces 2-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc, the British arm of oil giant Royal Dutch/Shell Group, on Thursday announced a two-for-one share split on June 26.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
